BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (  If I send money, it gets tripled, creating potential mutual benefit. However, there's uncertai) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    nty about how much will be returned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  I'll take a moderately cooperative approach to start:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  **My reasoning:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (  - Sending $3 means the receiver gets $9 \(3\3273\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (  - I initially keep $2) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  - This creates enough value that if the receiver is fair/cooperative, we both can benefit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (  - It signals willingness to trust without being maximally vulnerable) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  - In repeated games, building trust early can pay off) Tj ET
